You can get stronger and tougher by excercising (pushing around
boulders, etc), eating tins of spinach, eating giant corpses or tins of
giant meat, eating royal jelly, and quaffing potions of gain ability
(esp. blessed ones).

If you find a bag of holding, bless it.  And make sure you don't put
other magical bags inside, and that you don't put a wand of
cancellation inside.

For armor, dragon scale mail is the good stuff.  Grey and silver are
generally preferred (grey gives magic resistance, silver gives
reflection) although some of the others are nice.  They all give
excellent armor class at reasonable weight.


